/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Rendered manuscript artefacts — deliberately NOT versioned.
#
# manuscript.qmd is the source and IS tracked; these are generated from it by Quarto and
# scripts/fix_docx_*.py. They were tracked until 2026-10-16 and are removed here on purpose:
#
#   1. Double-blind review. The target journal's peer review conceals author identities, and a
#      public copy of the submitted PDF/DOCX defeats that from outside the process.
#   2. Self-archiving. The journal permits archiving only the PUBLISHED version, after
#      publication. Public pre-publication posting is not granted.
#   3. They are large binaries that change on every render, so tracking them churns history
#      for no benefit — the source and the code that rebuilds them are both here.
#
# Keep them locally; rebuild with:
#     cd manuscript; quarto render manuscript.qmd --to html
#     cd manuscript; quarto render manuscript.qmd --to pdf
#     cd manuscript; quarto render manuscript.qmd --to docx
#     python scripts/fix_docx_trp.py ; python scripts/verify_author_block.py
manuscript.pdf
manuscript.docx
manuscript.html
